t-size: 16px;"&gt;在一篇漫无目的的社交媒体帖子中，特朗普称赞他与朝鲜领导人金正恩的“非常良好的关系”，称他的政权“没有威胁性且相互尊重”。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;他再次抱怨美国在韩国驻军的成本，并强调李在明总统拒绝了他在伊朗问题上的帮助请求。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure style="margin: 20px 0;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/MJM7ijf-DBExO2JBvNrOc0M0OkjtkTI0UpHQgmBarvuI03yj2n87lw7suS8mKmLcPIDqio-smT9abvaclqQ7exmUGOR78KMCnYq1y6NBdQL_kv9qQmfL5SAj8FoTsmZxtREBVKNQFh2IVC-7_2qy9iLE8C-sMS9ILq1BHLakAkedyBgEOs-0IisyW0lzj6EfjhcqVvXDratCJ5tYn6N5yEvny6erwtZQrc7hUerhBMGpkQ5Oz0HkdvmFZc4Edn-c5JBpL0t99tBCZDybOQMkIr4JzlrzGTZGb_Nt1vpng4rP3VNg4SIbN3i3hbWOemUMgRfYTTQsssmc6ah5tMCBRpGtHN2--qT0n5v_zr4KHcluin-clwA7QvRhYpWeRDyvijMwiFrxFAx54JIsIOoMXxG1WJypQ_3aQx2ANrezmmeBGOphERcHQv3v6UcfkvlbFDD17znIlUqXjQrK6GsgwXthRrMkNLmlCFlDMCqABanaP99zGJZQ0QG_csSv9eBmaDVipK8Y0tYvlsiOsw/IBxRxDkhAXgIm7CcHZCdIq3qz8hcm0yN/23" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e; display: block; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;table width="580"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/ikFR9GsgBkHI/v3/-1x-1.jpg" alt="WATCH: North Korea raked in as much as $22 billion in foreign earnings over the last few years despite global sanctions." width="580"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;img alt="观看：尽管受到全球制裁，过去几年朝鲜的外汇收入仍高达 220 亿美元。" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/ikFR9GsgBkHI/v3/-1x-1.jpg" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-bottom: 0;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;table width="580"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iuquhjMLDeIY/v0/-1x-1.png" alt="Watch now" width="580"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;img alt="立即观看" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iuquhjMLDeIY/v0/-1x-1.png" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;" /